# The Docker build needs only mcp-server/ and src/config/*.json (see mcp-server/Dockerfile).
# Everything else is upload weight. This exists because `railway up` was uploading
# .claude/worktrees — 3.4 GB of agent worktree checkouts — and timing out before it
# could ship a config fix to a live service.
#
# Patterns are ANCHORED with a leading slash. Unanchored gitignore-style patterns match at
# EVERY level, so a bare `scripts/` also excluded `mcp-server/scripts/` and broke the build.
/.claude/
/.git/
/artifacts/
/cache/
/out/
/coverage/
/node_modules/
/forensics/
/comprehensive-tests/
/test/
/contracts/
/scripts/
/public/
/docs/
/python/
/backend/
/deployments/
/lib/
/examples/
/src/agents/
/src/integrations/
/src/test-suite/
/*.md
/*.log
/*.tar.gz
/*.patch
